text, compression, masks, scoring, and unrelated code. For n blocks, their zero-based retained indices are max(0,floor(n/2)-1) and max(0,n-2), respectively; these coincide only at n=1 or n=2. The current baseline and prior graph comparisons motivate this unmeasured contrast without establishing its mechanism.\"}","mechanism":"Compare a block-four readout with a matched block-six readout and the audited incumbent. CPU checks test depth-specific computation; frozen ranking comparisons test usefulness without establishing causal attribution.","predicted_observations":["Observed: current seed-42 HR@10 is 0.665, 0.572, 0.477, and 0.685 across the four categories; the unweighted mean is 0.59975.","Observed in current source: the eight-block dilation order is [1,2,4,8,8,4,2,1], and the readout uses the final block state and a strictly preceding context mean.","Observed counterevidence on older models: the dilation-order candidate gained only 0.0015 mean HR@10 against its then-baseline and lost 0.020 on Movies_and_TV; the item-identity and local-difference candidates missed their development gates. Their category slices are dependent parts of their aggregates.","Provisional: adding a small block-four contribution could improve ranking if later blocks attenuate useful features. The supplied measurements do not establish that deficit or a category-specific gain."]},"design_hash":"ee21520a0e30d344bbc69ca291e247e6f0fb96e74a8b0e77129a606fc0bffd8c","mechanism_status":"unknown","next_step":"Assess whether the implemented contrast isolates the proposed mechanism; design a discriminating follow-up for competing explanations.","qualification":"Paired development observation, not causal proof or independent replication.","slices":[{"candidate_minus_control":-0.018000000000000016,"dataset":"Movies_and_TV","seed":42},{"candidate_minus_control":-0.007000000000000006,"dataset":"Industrial_and_Scientific","seed":42},{"candidate_minus_control":0.0,"dataset":"Electronics","seed":42},{"candid